  <entry>
    <title>C++ 学习笔记(一):命名空间、输入输出与缺省参数</title>
    <link href="/2026/09/22/cpp-note-1/"/>
    <url>/2026/09/22/cpp-note-1/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h2 id="前言"><a href="#前言" class="headerlink" title="前言"></a>前言</h2><p>写 C 的时候,你一定碰到过这种尴尬:变量名跟库函数撞车,编译报「重定义」;<code>printf</code> 要自己记 <code>%d</code>、<code>%f</code> 一堆格式符,一不留神就写错。这些「坑」,C++ 都有对应的解法。</p><p>今天这篇笔记,带你搞清楚三件事:</p><ol><li><strong>命名空间</strong>:怎么让同名变量 &#x2F; 函数各过各的,互不打架;</li><li><strong>输入输出</strong>:<code>cout</code> &#x2F; <code>cin</code> 为什么不用写格式符就能自动识别类型;</li><li><strong>缺省参数</strong>:函数参数怎么能「不传也有默认值」。</li></ol><p>每个知识点都配了能直接跑的代码和运行结果,照着敲一遍就能懂。</p><h2 id="一、命名空间-namespace"><a href="#一、命名空间-namespace" class="headerlink" title="一、命名空间 namespace"></a>一、命名空间 namespace</h2><h3 id="1-问题-名字撞车了"><a href="#1-问题-名字撞车了" class="headerlink" title="1. 问题:名字撞车了"></a>1. 问题:名字撞车了</h3><p>在 C 里,如果全局定义了一个叫 <code>rand</code> 的变量,而 <code>&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</code> 里已经有一个 <code>rand()</code> 函数,编译器直接报「重定义」:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 里面有 rand() 函数</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> rand = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">// 撞名了!</span><br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, rand);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果(编译失败):</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">error C2365: &quot;rand&quot;: 重定义;以前的定义是&quot;函数&quot;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>根因</strong>:C 里所有名字都在同一个全局「大房间」里,重名就冲突。</p><h3 id="2-解决-用-namespace-隔开"><a href="#2-解决-用-namespace-隔开" class="headerlink" title="2. 解决:用 namespace 隔开"></a>2. 解决:用 namespace 隔开</h3><p><code>namespace</code> 相当于给代码开了个独立的「房间」,房间里可以放变量、函数、类型,访问时用 <code>命名空间::成员</code>:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> bit<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> rand = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;               <span class="hljs-comment">// 变量</span><br>    <span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">Add</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> left, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> right)</span> <span class="hljs-comment">// 函数</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function">    </span>&#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> left + right;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span>                  <span class="hljs-comment">// 类型</span><br>    &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span>* next;<br>        <span class="hljs-type">int</span> val;<br>    &#125;;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, bit::rand);       <span class="hljs-comment">// 访问 bit 房间里的 rand</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, bit::<span class="hljs-built_in">Add</span>(<span class="hljs-number">1</span>, <span class="hljs-number">2</span>));  <span class="hljs-comment">// 调用 bit 房间里的 Add</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">bit</span>::Node n;              <span class="hljs-comment">// 用 bit 房间里的类型</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果:</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">10<br>3<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>现在 <code>bit::rand</code> 和库里的 <code>rand()</code> 各在各的房间,不再冲突。</p><h3 id="3-同名也不怕-两个命名空间各放一个"><a href="#3-同名也不怕-两个命名空间各放一个" class="headerlink" title="3. 同名也不怕:两个命名空间各放一个"></a>3. 同名也不怕:两个命名空间各放一个</h3><p>同一个名字,放在不同的命名空间里就是两个不同的东西:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> first<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> var = <span class="hljs-number">5</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> second<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">double</span> var = <span class="hljs-number">3.1416</span>;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    cout &lt;&lt; first::var &lt;&lt; endl;   <span class="hljs-comment">// 5</span><br>    cout &lt;&lt; second::var &lt;&lt; endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 3.1416</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果:</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">5<br>3.1416<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>两个 <code>var</code> 同名,但因为住在不同的「房间」,互不干扰。</p><h3 id="4-作用域查找规则与"><a href="#4-作用域查找规则与" class="headerlink" title="4. 作用域查找规则与 ::"></a>4. 作用域查找规则与 <code>::</code></h3><p>编译时查找名字的规则:<strong>先在局部找,再到全局找</strong>。<code>::</code> 是域作用限定符,左边不写命名空间时表示全局作用域:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;stdio.h&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> rand = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>; <span class="hljs-comment">// 全局变量</span><br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> rand = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;           <span class="hljs-comment">// 局部变量</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, rand);   <span class="hljs-comment">// 局部优先,输出 1</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">printf</span>(<span class="hljs-string">&quot;%d\n&quot;</span>, ::rand); <span class="hljs-comment">// :: 指定全局,输出 10</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果:</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">1<br>10<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="5-嵌套-多文件合并"><a href="#5-嵌套-多文件合并" class="headerlink" title="5. 嵌套 &amp; 多文件合并"></a>5. 嵌套 &amp; 多文件合并</h3><p>命名空间可以嵌套;多个文件里定义的<strong>同名</strong> namespace 在编译时会自动合并成一个。但同一个命名空间内不能有同名成员,否则照样报重定义:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> bit<br>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> bit1 &#123; <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span> &#123; <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span>* next; <span class="hljs-type">int</span> val; &#125;; &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> bit2 &#123; <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span> &#123; <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span>* next; <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">Node</span>* prev; <span class="hljs-type">int</span> val; &#125;; &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">bit</span>::bit1::Node n1;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">struct</span> <span class="hljs-title class_">bit</span>::bit2::Node n2;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="二、C-的输入输出"><a href="#二、C-的输入输出" class="headerlink" title="二、C++ 的输入输出"></a>二、C++ 的输入输出</h2><p>C 用 <code>printf</code> &#x2F; <code>scanf</code>,要手写 <code>%d</code>、<code>%f</code>、<code>%s</code> 这些格式符;C++ 用 <code>cout</code> &#x2F; <code>cin</code>,<strong>自动识别类型</strong>,不用记格式符:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">double</span> j = <span class="hljs-number">11.11</span>;<br><br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hello world&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; std::endl; <span class="hljs-comment">// endl 是换行</span><br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; i &lt;&lt; std::endl;   <span class="hljs-comment">// 整型直接输出</span><br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; j &lt;&lt; std::endl;   <span class="hljs-comment">// 浮点直接输出</span><br>    std::cout &lt;&lt; &amp;i &lt;&lt; std::endl;  <span class="hljs-comment">// 连地址都能直接输出</span><br><br>    std::cin &gt;&gt; i;                 <span class="hljs-comment">// 从键盘读一个数到 i</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果(前四行):</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">hello world<br>10<br>11.11<br>0000002B1B4FF9B4<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><code>&amp;i</code> 是地址,每次运行会变。注意:用 <code>cout</code> &#x2F; <code>cin</code> 要引入头文件 <code>&lt;iostream&gt;</code>(不再是 <code>&lt;stdio.h&gt;</code>)。</p><h3 id="using-namespace-std-的三种姿势"><a href="#using-namespace-std-的三种姿势" class="headerlink" title="using namespace std 的三种姿势"></a>using namespace std 的三种姿势</h3><p><code>std</code> 是 C++ 标准库的命名空间,<code>cout</code>、<code>cin</code>、<code>string</code> 都在里面。访问它们有三种写法:</p><table><thead><tr><th>写法</th><th>示例</th><th>优缺点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>全限定名</td><td><code>std::cout &lt;&lt; x;</code></td><td>最安全,但每次都要写 <code>std::</code></td></tr><tr><td>using 声明(推荐)</td><td><code>using std::cout;</code> 后直接 <code>cout &lt;&lt; x;</code></td><td>只引入要用的几个,兼顾方便与安全</td></tr><tr><td>using 指令</td><td><code>using namespace std;</code></td><td>全展开最省事,但容易撞名,项目里不推荐</td></tr></tbody></table><p>折中写法(第二种)长这样:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> std::cout;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> std::endl;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> std::cin;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>;<br>    cout &lt;&lt; <span class="hljs-string">&quot;hello world&quot;</span> &lt;&lt; endl;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; i;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><blockquote><p>一句话记:头文件里<strong>别</strong>用 <code>using namespace</code>,源文件里<strong>少用</strong>,真要方便就用 <code>using std::cout</code> 这种折中。</p></blockquote><h2 id="三、缺省参数"><a href="#三、缺省参数" class="headerlink" title="三、缺省参数"></a>三、缺省参数</h2><p>缺省参数 &#x3D; 给形参一个默认值。调用时<strong>不传就用默认值,传了就用实参</strong>:</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-meta">#<span class="hljs-keyword">include</span> <span class="hljs-string">&lt;iostream&gt;</span></span><br><span class="hljs-keyword">using</span> <span class="hljs-keyword">namespace</span> std;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">Func</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>)</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    cout &lt;&lt; a &lt;&lt; endl;<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> <span class="hljs-title">main</span><span class="hljs-params">()</span></span><br><span class="hljs-function"></span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">Func</span>();    <span class="hljs-comment">// 不传参,用默认值</span><br>    <span class="hljs-built_in">Func</span>(<span class="hljs-number">10</span>);  <span class="hljs-comment">// 传参,用实参</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-number">0</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>运行结果:</p><figure class="highlight text"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs text">0<br>10<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h3 id="全缺省与半缺省"><a href="#全缺省与半缺省" class="headerlink" title="全缺省与半缺省"></a>全缺省与半缺省</h3><ul><li><strong>全缺省</strong>:所有参数都有默认值;</li><li><strong>半缺省</strong>:只有靠右的一部分参数有默认值。</li></ul><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">// 全缺省:三个参数都有默认值</span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">Func1</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a = <span class="hljs-number">10</span>, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> c = <span class="hljs-number">30</span>)</span> </span>&#123; ... &#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// 半缺省:只有 b、c 有默认值,a 必须传</span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">void</span> <span class="hljs-title">Func2</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> a, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> b = <span class="hljs-number">20</span>, <span class="hljs-type">int</span> c = <span class="hljs-number">30</span>)</span> </span>&#123; ... &#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p><strong>铁律</strong>:缺省参数必须<strong>从右往左连续</strong>给,不能跳着给。<code>void Func(int a = 1, int b, int c = 3)</code> 就是错的——<code>a</code> 有默认值而 <code>b</code> 没有,中间断了,会有歧义。</p><h2 id="四、踩坑记录"><a href="#四、踩坑记录" class="headerlink" title="四、踩坑记录"></a>四、踩坑记录</h2><p><strong>坑 1:<code>rand</code> 重定义</strong></p><ul><li>现象:全局写 <code>int rand = 10;</code> → 编译报 <code>error C2365: &quot;rand&quot;: 重定义</code></li><li>原因:和 <code>&lt;stdlib.h&gt;</code> 里的 <code>rand()</code> 函数撞名</li><li>解决:放进 <code>namespace</code> 隔离开,或换个不撞的名字</li></ul><p><strong>坑 2:<code>Func2</code> 注释和定义对不上</strong></p><ul><li>现象:我注释标的是「半缺省」,但定义写的是 <code>void Func2(int a = 10, int b = 20, int c = 30)</code></li><li>原因:三个参数都有默认值,这其实是<strong>全缺省</strong>;真正的半缺省应该是 <code>void Func2(int a, int b = 20, int c = 30)</code></li><li>教训:注释和定义要对得上,不然会误导自己(和看代码的人)</li></ul><h2 id="五、小结与下一步"><a href="#五、小结与下一步" class="headerlink" title="五、小结与下一步"></a>五、小结与下一步</h2><table><thead><tr><th>知识点</th><th>一句话要点</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>命名空间</td><td>给代码开独立「房间」,<code>命名空间::成员</code> 访问;可嵌套、多文件同名自动合并</td></tr><tr><td>作用域查找</td><td>局部优先于全局;<code>::</code> 指定全局</td></tr><tr><td>输入输出</td><td><code>cout</code> &#x2F; <code>cin</code> 自动识别类型,免去格式符</td></tr><tr><td>using 三姿势</td><td>全限定最安全;<code>using std::cout</code> 折中;<code>using namespace std</code> 有冲突风险</td></tr><tr><td>缺省参数</td><td>不传用默认值;必须从右往左连续;分全缺省 &#x2F; 半缺省</td></tr></tbody></table><p><strong>下一步计划</strong>:函数重载、引用、内联函数。这几个和缺省参数经常一起考,下一篇接着聊。</p><hr><p><em>如果有哪里写错了,欢迎在评论区指出,感谢阅读!</em></p>]]></content>
    
    
